; Chapter 4
# Label_Clover
@set currentChapter=4
@set badEndingCounter=0
; open the clover website
@onOpenCloverCommand

;  Beata appears on the right side of the screen. 
@printer Bubble.right pos:105,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Right pos:60,70

Beata: "Before you continue browsing this page, I must warn you that it might still contain materials some users would find inappropriate."
Beata: "Would you like me to block it for you?"

@choice "Ignore it" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Ignore_It
@choice "Piss off" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Piss_Off
@choice "Might still contain?" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Might_Still_Contain
@stop




# Label_Ignore_It
@showPrinter Bubble
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: The moment I start talking to AI is the moment I officially lose my mind.

@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing



# Label_Piss_Off
; bad option, increament bad ending counter
@set badEndingCounter=badEndingCounter+1

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "No. And piss off."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
@wait 0.5
Beata: "Of course!"

@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing





# Label_Might_Still_Contain

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: "Might still contain?"
Noa: "Ah. I see what Maurice meant now."
Noa: "Your masters’ doing, I assume?"

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "All we want is to make the web a safer place for everyone!"

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "Mhm. Sure. I’ve heard seeing nipples might cause a heart attack."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "Such an outcome is unheard of."
Beata: "However, children use the web too."
Beata: "And we should do everything we can to ensure their safety!"

@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing


# Label_Continue_Browsing
; Beata disappears
@printer Bubble.Right pos:150,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble


@stop


; ;  Player clicks on the Statue picture.(an event will  be triggered in unity code

# Label_Statue_Picture_Clicked
; clear the dialogue box text
@resetText Dialogue
@resetText Bubble

; wait for a moment (player can not click anything during this time)
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@wait 1.5

; Beata appears on the right side of the screen.
@printer Bubble.right pos:105,70
@wait 0.5
@showPrinter Bubble
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
@printer Bubble.Right pos:60,70

Beata: "Do you enjoy art, Noa?"

@choice "Ignore it" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Ignore_It_Statue
@choice "No" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_No_Statue
@choice "Not this kind" handler:ButtonList goto:.Label_Not_This_Kind_Statue




# Label_Ignore_It_Statue
@resetText Dialogue
@showPrinter Dialogue 
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand
Noa: I need to focus.

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_Statue
@stop



# Label_No_Statue

@showPrinter Dialogue 
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

Noa: "No."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "I see!"
Beata: "Would you like me to send you a list of 10 paintings that will make you fall in love with art?"


@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "..."
Noa: "No."


@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_Statue
@stop





# Label_Not_This_Kind_Statue

@showPrinter Dialogue 
@printer Dialogue !hideOther
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

Noa: "I would enjoy it more if the statue were naked."
Noa: "You know, how it’s actually supposed to be."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "I see!"
Beata: "Unfortunately, nudity violates Section 64 of the Online Safety Act."

@printer Dialogue !hideOther
Noa: "It’s a statue."
Noa: "You know, back in my days, the web was a wild place."
Noa: "And people didn’t faint at the sight of a naked statue."

@printer Bubble.Right !hideOther
Beata: "It’s good that those days are over, isn’t it?"
Beata: "And everyone can feel safe!"

@goto .Label_Continue_Browsing_After_Statue
@stop








# Label_Continue_Browsing_After_Statue
; Beata disappears
@printer Bubble.Right pos:150,70
@wait 0.5
@hidePrinter Bubble
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand
@stop






# Label_Creepy_People_Picture_Clicked
; clear the dialogue box text
@resetText Dialogue
@resetText Bubble

; show dialogue box
@onDialogueOpenedCommand


@wait 1.5
@printer Dialogue

Noa: What am I even looking at?
Noa: Regardless, it’s disgusting.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@stop


# Label_Naked_Woman_Picture_Clicked
; clear the dialogue box text
@resetText Dialogue
@resetText Bubble 

; show dialogue box
@onDialogueOpenedCommand

@wait 1.5
@printer Dialogue
Noa: Knowing how much money people pay Alex for photos, I’m sure this girl will be ecstatic to see this.

; hide dialogue box
@hidePrinter Dialogue
@onDialogueClosedCommand

@stop






# Pick_Favorite_Website_Section

; show choice to pick a favorite website
@choice "Stay on Page" handler:ButtonList
@choice "Chatter" handler:ButtonList goto:Chapter5/Chapter5
@stop




